# Impeccable hook cache — machine-specific, may appear in any content subdir
# Impeccable: the hook cache and live-mode scratch are machine-local, but the
# detector CONFIG is a project decision — track it, or a waiver added on one
# machine silently changes what the design gate sees everywhere else.
**/.impeccable/*
!**/.impeccable/config.json
